    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Peerless Divine Emperor",
        "jpn": null
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "绝世神皇 (Jue Shi Shen Huang, lit. “Peerless Divine Emperor”) is a Chinese fantasy martial arts donghua centered on reincarnation, revenge, and family duty. The story follows Jing Yunxiao, once the supreme Reincarnation Emperor of the Dragon Domain Continent, who is betrayed and forced to use the Five-Turn Reincarnation Technique. Reborn as a youth of the Jing family in Hongye Town, he retains his past-life memories and helps his clan resist the Black Dragon Stronghold. In the struggle, his grandfather Jing Yufeng is gravely injured, compelling Yunxiao to take responsibility for saving his family. His journey leads him to Huangshi City in search of medicine, where he begins rebuilding his destiny.",
        "jpn": null
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Jue Shi Shen Huang"
    ],
